TESTS : section H (5 assertions) = resolving null + 9 verbes sans exercice
verrouillés + supportType couverts → 68 → 73. tsc 0 · tests 73/73 ·
build ✓ 8,5 s · module servi : 0 occurrence de TRAINING_EXERCISES[0].
